<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>快送外卖</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1440px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .nav {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .nav a {
            color: #337ab7;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }
        .nav a:hover {
            color: #23527c;
        }
        .categories {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .category {
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
            width: 200px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .category img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 150px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .category h2 {
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            clear: both;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>快送外卖</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="nav">
            <a href=".">首页</a>
            <a href="restaurants.html">餐厅列表</a>
            <a href="about.html">关于我们</a>
        </div>
        <h2>热门分类</h2>
        <div class="categories">
            <div class="category">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x150?text=%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87" alt="中餐">
                <h2>中餐</h2>
                <p>各种美味的中式菜肴</p>
                <a href="restaurants.html" class="btn">查看餐厅</a>
            </div>
            <div class="category">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x150?text=%E8%A5%B2%E9%A1%B5" alt="西餐">
                <h2>西餐</h2>
                <p>西式快餐和正餐</p>
                <a href="restaurants.html" class="btn">查看餐厅</a>
            </div>
            <div class="category">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x150?text=%E7%BE%8A%E9%A3%9F" alt="甜品">
                <h2>甜品</h2>
                <p>各种甜点和小吃</p>
                <a href="restaurants.html" class="btn">查看餐厅</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2023 快送外卖</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

